No concerns. No fabrication, vague extraction, silent re-litigation, invented enumeration, or collapsed distinction was found in the sampled citations. (The Illinois HTTP-first/dormant-Phase-B characterization in §2.4 is inherited from the accepted HA-01/HA-02 findings and cited to them jointly with the blueprint; consistent with the state the producing model was working from.)

